Bundled third-party material
---------------------------
assets/audio/librispeech-clean-test-en-30s/audio.wav is derived from
LibriSpeech, prepared by Vassil Panayotov with assistance from Daniel Povey.
Source: https://www.openslr.org/12
Mirror: https://huggingface.co/datasets/openslr/librispeech_asr
Dataset revision: 71cacbfb7e2354c4226d01e70d77d5fca3d04ba1
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0).
See licenses/CC-BY-4.0.txt and https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

AC-Prof concatenated clean/test recordings 6930-75918-0001,
6930-75918-0002 and 6930-75918-0003, then retained the first 30 seconds as
16 kHz mono PCM16 WAV. It did not normalize, resample, apply gain or trim
silence. The source identities, hashes and transformation details are in
assets/audio/librispeech-clean-test-en-30s/source.json.
The audio retains CC-BY-4.0 and is not relicensed under Apache-2.0.

